<p>08/07/26</p>
<p><img src="/image/kcain.jpg" alt="" /></p>
<p>we have a new band member: a kinetic multicellular ceramic sound sculpture suspended in the sky.</p>
<p>kelli and i are playing music this month celebrating the unveiling of her new collection of ceramic vessels. <em><a href="https://www.bushelcollective.org/exhibition-one-dreams-up-another-kelli-cain-anthony-chase/">one dreams up another</a></em> opens august 8 in delhi, new york. durational performances are saturday august 22 and sunday august 30 from 11am-2pm at half hidden, upstairs from <a href="https://luckdragon.space/">luck dragon</a>. free and open to everyone. perhaps a broadcast if we can manage it.</p>
<p>still no timeline for norns. while taking a break from battling supply chains and tariffs and forecasts i scavenged the depths of the workshop and emerged with a small batch of what i'm calling b-stock norns. i can say for certain this is the last of our stock.</p>
<p>and a reminder that if you'd like to purchase in person, we can recommend some incredible hikes and secret waterfalls and also offer a cash discount.</p>
